# Workaround for Omnis bug ST/BE/344, fixed in Studio 5 (ST500-003) Oct 2008.

If pObjRef.$objtype=kBobj
	Calculate path as pObjRef.$fullname
	Calculate containerPath as mid(path,1,rpos('.$objs',path)-1)
Else
	Calculate containerPath as pObjRef.$container().$fullname
End If

Quit method containerPath